          "issueTime" : 1756093366202,
          "openCommentState" : "PUBLIC",
          "createTime" : 1756093366202,
          "readPermission" : "PUBLIC",
          "contentText" : "I'm deep into NBA Hoop Grid Reverse #512, and I've successfully cracked the most popular answer for every single square – all but one! This particular box is proving to be a real head-scratcher. I need a player who was active in the 2010s and, during any season of their career, averaged less than 10 points per game. It sounds straightforward, but the top guesses like Shaq, Brian Scalabrine, Anthony Bennett, Ben Simmons, and Vince Carter are all off the mark. I've already cycled through all the fan-favorite 'meme' players such as JaVale McGee, JR Smith, and Nick Young, plus a host of legends including Dirk Nowitzki, Tracy McGrady, Tim Duncan, and Andre Iguodala. Any bright ideas out there? Do you think you know the elusive answer?",
          "likeCount" : 0,
          "id" : "68abdbb625700f6c36369940",
          "title" : null,
          "userId" : 99678068,
          "matchId" : null,
          "commentCount" : 0
        },
        "sort" : [
