        "_score" : null,
        "_source" : {
          "issueTime" : 1756085146834,
          "openCommentState" : "PUBLIC",
          "createTime" : 1756085146834,
          "readPermission" : "PUBLIC",
          "contentText" : "Hold on a minute! During today's Real Madrid vs Oviedo match, it looks like Opta made a blunder. They credited Garcia with a shot on target instead of Tchouameni in the 78th minute, off an Mbappe corner. I had a bet on Tchouameni for a SOT at +210, so this is pretty frustrating. The replays clearly show it was Tchouameni, and even the commentators were saying his name. Is there a way to challenge this, or do I just have to wait for Opta to hopefully correct it themselves?",
          "likeCount" : 0,
          "id" : "68abbb9a3a0dcb7feb8e292b",
          "title" : null,
          "userId" : 99979136,
          "matchId" : null,
          "commentCount" : 1
        },
        "sort" : [
          1756085146834
        ]
      },
      {
        "_index" : "article",
        "_type" : "_doc",
        "_id" : "68abb9483a0dcb7feb8e28bb",
        "_score" : null,
        "_source" : {
          "issueTime" : 1756084552485,
          "openCommentState" : "PUBLIC",
          "createTime" : 1756084552485,
          "readPermission" : "PUBLIC",
          "contentText" : """In the second round of La Liga, Real Oviedo hosted Real Madrid. In the first half, Arda Güler provided an assist for Kylian Mbappé to open the scoring. In the second half, Vinícius set up Mbappé to double the lead. During stoppage time, Vinícius added a low shot to seal the win. The match ended with Real Madrid defeating Real Oviedo 3-0, securing their second consecutive victory.
""",
          "likeCount" : 0,
          "id" : "68abb9483a0dcb7feb8e28bb",
          "title" : "",
          "userId" : 99680744,
          "matchId" : "2804311",
